    <briefdescription>
<para>Options controlling document ingestion into the LLM Wiki index. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Passed to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1llm__wiki_1_1_i_l_l_m_wiki_plugin_1a06d2ba30a839e13275853b941f35376b" kindref="member">ILLMWikiPlugin::ingest()</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1llm__wiki_1_1_i_l_l_m_wiki_plugin_1a2c2ce8a1cc191bf86791905a781160d5" kindref="member">ILLMWikiPlugin::wikiIngest()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1plugins_1_1llm__wiki_1_1_wiki_ingest_options_1a3a3e3d0a92f66bf64a0fce27c10b93e5" kindref="member">embedding_provider</ref></computeroutput> must be one of <computeroutput>"hash"</computeroutput> (default, no deps), <computeroutput>"mock"</computeroutput> (tests), <computeroutput>"sentence-transformers"</computeroutput> (requires Python bridge in enterprise builds), or <computeroutput>"openai"</computeroutput> (requires <computeroutput>OPENAI_API_KEY</computeroutput>). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
